The following is the message of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng: The Ministry of Water Resources issued the announcement of the second weather forecast for 2021, this year's rainy season will come in the first week of May
The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology (MoWRM) would like to inform the public about the second weather forecast for 2021 as follows: :
1: Global phenomena:
A: Early rainy season: The 2021 rainy season will arrive in the first week of May, with moderate to heavy rainfall likely to be higher than average for most of the year and scattered rainfall. At the beginning of the rainy season, there will be heavy rain, thunderstorms and strong winds.
B: Mid-rainy season: From August to September, the rainfall will be scattered over the country with moderate to heavy rainfall will be higher than the average for many years.
In the middle of the rainy season, there will be heavy rain, thunderstorms and strong winds, which will cause some provinces to be at high risk of flooding.
C: End of rainy season: The rainy season may end in the fourth week of November with light to moderate rainfall.
4: Storm situation: In 2021, the number of storms is likely to be around 28-30, storms in the Pacific Ocean will be more likely to occur directly in the South China Sea.
According to the weather conditions as predicted and informed above, the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology would like to inform the relevant ministries, institutions, local authorities and the public.
