Commentary: Friendship between China's First Blue Hat Forces and Cambodia
On April 24, 1992, the first 400 Chinese Blue Hat Army Military Engineering Corps arrived in Kampong Som, Cambodia. This is the first time China has sent troops to a UN peacekeeping operation tasked with repairing roads and airports.
High temperatures in the tropics, rough roads, landmines ... the conditions for peacekeeping operations are very difficult, however, the faces of the peacekeepers still show their determination. In fact, they have already undergone urgent training in China, covering topics such as proper mining and demining, topography, geography, culture, humanity and Cambodian customs.
After inspection and acceptance, the inspection and reception team of the United Nations Headquarters in Cambodia organized a party for the Chinese Blue Hat Forces. From then on, at the UN headquarters, there was always an action, when Chinese soldiers would raise their thumbs and praise, "China is great."
