BEIJING, April 20 (Xinhua) - Chinese President Xi Jinping delivered a speech at the opening ceremony of the 2021 annual meeting of the Baoan Forum on Asia on April 20 in Bao'an, Hainan Province, China. Congratulations to overcome obstacles, destiny and together build the future "through the video.
Xi Jinping pointed out that over the past 20 years, Asia has deepened regional economic integration and worked together to promote socio-economic development in order to make Asia the region with the greatest vitality and growth potential. The world.
As a key member of Asia, China has continuously deepened its reform and opening-up efforts to actively promote regional cooperation for development with Asia and jointly develop with the rest of the world. This forum is a testament to the extraordinary journey of China, Asia and the world, and plays an important role in influencing and motivating the development of Asia and the world.
Xi Jinping said that international affairs should be resolved jointly, consulting the future and the fate of the world should be governed by countries. The laws set by one country or a small number of countries cannot be enforced by other countries, and the unilateralism of one country should not affect the interests of the whole world. The world needs justice, but not hegemony. Big countries need to show more responsibility.
He stressed that "the belt and the road" is a big road that is open for us to join hands and move forward, not a one-way street. All interested countries can join to cooperate for mutual benefit. The joint construction of the "Belt and Road" is for the purpose of joint development, focusing on win-win and bring hope.
Xi Jinping stressed that no matter how developed China is, it will not seek hegemony, no expansion and no permanent extension of power, as well as no arms race. China will continue to be the founder of global peace, a contributor to global development and a supporter of international order.
Xi Jinping said that in the relations between the two countries, equality, mutual respect and trust must be given priority, and the constant encroachment and interference in the internal affairs of other countries cannot be supported. No. Promote the common values of humanity: peace, progress, justice, truth, democracy and freedom, initiate different civilizations to change and learn from each other to promote the development of human civilization.
Xi Jinping said that now is an era full of challenges and hopes. What is the direction of human society? How should we create a future for the next generation? The Chinese side would like to initiate that Asia and the whole world respond to the call of the times to join hands in the fight against Kovid 19 and increase global governance to achieve the goal of building a unified community of humanity.
In particular, 20 years after its inception, the Asia Forum has focused on Asia and welcomed the whole world, becoming one of the world's most influential international forums. Xi Jinping attended the opening ceremony of the Asia-Pacific Forum five times, and he used Chinese poetic phrases to vividly explain the meaning of mutual benefit and win-win.
