* Individuals are prohibited from traveling out of their current residence or lodging, including not being allowed to engage in sports activities outside their residence or lodging, except for travel for emergency medical reasons and work. Visit health officials for samples to be tested for Kovid-19 or to be vaccinated against Kovid-19 at the nearest location in the Red Zone as scheduled and with the permission of the relevant authorities.
