Ministry of Tourism issues instructions on how to work for officials in the Ministry and Department of Tourism of Phnom Penh and Kandal Province during the closing of Phnom Penh and Takhmao
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism on April 18, 2021 issued guidelines on the determination of working procedures and assignment of officials to work at the Ministry of Tourism at the Department of Tourism in Phnom Penh and at the Department of Tourism in Kandal Province during the packaging. Geography of Phnom Penh and Takhmao City of Kandal Province to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
In this important instruction, the Ministry of Tourism has instructed the leaders and civil servants of the Ministry of Tourism, the Department of Tourism of Phnom Penh and the Department of Tourism of Kandal Province to follow the work method and assign officers to work during the geographical packing of the capital. Phnom Penh and Takhmao City of Kandal Province as follows:
1: Suspend unnecessary work temporarily during the closing of this package until further notification by the Royal Government.
2. The General Department of Administration and Finance, as well as the Cabinet of Ministers, shall assign daily officers, especially the Department of Administration and General Affairs, to manage security, order, safety and hygiene at the Ministry's office.
3. Professional work divisions in the General Departments, Departments of the Department of Tourism of Phnom Penh and Department of Tourism of Kandal Province shall reduce the number of officers to work to a minimum level not to exceed 2% of the total number of officers of each unit and must implement the food policy. Noon at work.
4. Leaders and officers must continue to carry out their work according to their plans and activities, allowing them to work and communicate remotely or online.
5. The head of each unit of the Ministry of Tourism shall make a schedule and a list of officers to work in accordance with the 2% principle, taking turns clearly and then sending to the Department of Human Resources to make a mission order. Officers should be recruited with an address in Khan 7 Makara (near the Ministry of Tourism) to reduce travel time.
6. For the Department of Tourism of Phnom Penh and the Department of Tourism of Kandal Province, it is necessary to ask for additional guidance from the Administration of Phnom Penh and the Administration of Kandal Province for the appointment of officers to be stationed and perform this necessary work.
7: On the way to work, officials assigned to work, please show the civil servant ID card or administrative certificate (for contracted officers) and mission order to the authority or local authority (which is the traffic inspector). Exit-in) and must travel to the designated destination. On the way back, orient your home.
8: All leaders and civil servants must continue to strictly implement the "3 protection and 3 com" measures of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia to participate in preventing the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
