According to the Cambodian Rice Federation, in addition to the mechanism to prevent the increase in food prices, especially "rice", the Green Trade Company of the Ministry of Commerce and the Cambodian Rice Federation, which has been launched and implemented since April 15, In 2021, some members of the Cambodian Rice Federation, which have retail depots that are still in stock and can operate in the closed area, decided to join the Royal Government by agreeing to reduce the price of rice more.
What types of businesses are allowed to operate during the closure of Phnom Penh and Takhmao?
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia, in order to eradicate the spread of Kovid 19 in Phnom Penh and Takhmao City, which is spreading rapidly, has decided to close down Phnom Penh and Takhmao City. The blockade put in place measures not to allow people to leave their homes and businesses to be banned.
However, some government institutions and businesses are allowed to continue to ensure the provision of essential services, food supplies and meet the basic needs of the people. The following activities, occupations or businesses may be allowed to operate:
The work activities of all types of armed forces and sub-national administrations, as well as health officials and staff, shall be carried out in accordance with the necessary and as determined by the head of each institution.
* Factories, handicrafts, or places for the production of medicines and medical equipment, including masses of alcohol and oxygen.
* Factories, enterprises, handicrafts or places for the production of food and groceries, including slaughterhouses, which are daily necessities.
* All work, business or business activities that take place online must reduce the number of employees to a minimum of 2% and apply the lunch policy at the workplace.
* Hotel and guesthouse services, but must reduce the number of staff to a minimum of not more than 2% and must apply the principle of food and accommodation at the workplace, except for hotels that serve as the number of staff. Minimum staffing and working hours of employees shall be determined by the competent authority that implements the closure measures.
* Delivery of food or groceries to serve the closed geography. This transport activity is not allowed to transport people.
* General freight services in - out or through geographically blocked to serve the socio-economic sector of the country. This transport activity is not allowed to transport people.
* For the management and maintenance of warehouses or groceries, a minimum number of staff is allowed and the principles of food and accommodation must be applied at the place of work.
* Transportation of individuals who have completed the procedure and patients from the hospital or hospital with the permission and coordination of the competent authority and other necessary occupational or business activities with the permission of the competent authority. .
* All permitted work, business or business activities as described above, everyone is obliged to implement health measures, including wearing a mask and keeping a safe distance, as well as adhering to hygiene to disinfect and measure Heat to fight and prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
On Sunday, April 18, 2021, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration also issued an additional instruction to factory owners and enterprises that provide preference for this business to send the names of employees requesting certificates from the Capital Hall and 14 Khan authorities to Facilitate staff travel.
In order to facilitate the travel of the staff, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration has recommended as follows:
1: Prepare a list of workers of its business location by reducing the number to a minimum of not more than 2% of the total number of employees or workers (attached to the list of staff and workers) and must Attach proof of 2% of employees from the owner of the enterprise or business owner.
In order to ensure the normalization of people's lives in accordance with the decision of the Royal Government to travel in Phnom Penh during the closure through a new instruction on Sunday, April 18, 2021, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration has introduced For those who need to prioritize travel, the following conditions must be met:
2: To apply to the OWSO of Phnom Penh Capital Administration or to the OWSO of the 14 Khan administrations, especially in the Khan where its business location is located, to issue a certificate of entry and exit. Geography of Phnom Penh to business owners and employees.
At the same time, the provincial authorities call on all people to know how to protect themselves by respecting the protection measures of the Ministry of Health, such as the recommendation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen "3 do not and 3 protect" and if not necessary do not go out.
Mr. Toch Poliva said that under the care of the Provincial Anti-Kovid-19 Commission, which has the Provincial Governor as the Chief of Svay Rieng Provincial Administration, he hoped that the situation of Kovid-19 in the province would be relieved when Coming soon.
At the same time, he called on all citizens to increase vigilance, especially to adhere to the measures of the head of the Royal Government "3 do not and 3 protect" and the decisions or instructions issued by the provincial administration. There is no need to stay at home and work together to eradicate the root cause of Kovid-19, starting with the cooperation of all citizens.
