"Kovid-19 is now active and happy to find easy-to-reach places in crowded places, such as markets, casinos and factories, which are all crowded places," she said.
Once an individual is infected with the Kovid-19 virus at these locations and arrives at home, it can be passed on to the family, even to young children, regardless of age. Therefore, if you do not continue to pay close attention to the implementation of the "3 prevention and 3 do not get vaccinated + at home temporarily", the life of one person or many people will be taken because of Kovid-19 disease. Easily. This is according to the addition of Mrs. O Vandin.
