Russian warplanes escorted US reconnaissance aircraft until US planes flew away from the Russian border and US reconnaissance aircraft did not enter Russian airspace. Last weekend, Russian MiG-31 fighter jets also intercepted a US RC-135 reconnaissance aircraft over the Pacific Ocean.
