The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and the Department of Labor and Vocational Training of Kandal Province will continue to provide "entry-exit permits" upon request and specific requirements to representatives of factories, enterprises and handicrafts that are allowed to conduct business activities during Implement temporary closure measures at all working hours.
