(Svay Rieng): The Svay Rieng Provincial Administration has issued instructions on the suspension of all types of alcohol and the suspension of 14-day rallies from April 16 to April 29, 2021 in Svay Rieng province. This is according to the instructions received by Fresh News.
According to the instructions, in order to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease in the "February 20 community" event and in order to protect the lives of the people, public health and public order, Svay Rieng Provincial Administration would like to introduce the following necessary measures. :
1: Suspend the sale of all kinds of alcohol (beer - all kinds of wine) in Svay Rieng province
2. All public markets, private markets, marts, restaurants, cafes, food stalls, cafes, beverages, food and beverage business locations and alcohol distribution depots in the province shall be temporarily suspended from all types of alcohol sales.
3. People must stay in their respective homes for large gatherings from house to house, drinking alcohol and playing bass and dancing at home is strictly prohibited.
