This person violated Sub-Decree No. 37 on "Health Measures to Prevent the Outbreak of Kovid 19 and Other Deadly and Serious Infectious Diseases" promulgated by the Royal Government on 12 March. 2021.
On the morning of April 12, 2021, Mr. Ung Kimleang, Deputy Provincial Governor, Provincial Secretary of Kovid 19, representing Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Pursat and Chairman of the Kovid 19 Provincial Commission, chaired a meeting to enforce the law. Involved in the transition of Kovid 19.
In that, Mr. Muong Sophean, after completing 14 days of martial arts, received a negative result of Kovid 19 for the third time, he came to receive a fine of 1 million Riel before the law for his mistakes.
Please be informed that Article 22 of Sub-Decree 37 stipulates that a transitional fine of 1,000,000 Riels to 5,000,000 Riels shall be imposed on any person who avoids performing the Taksalisak or escapes from the place of Chatsalisak during the practice of Chatsalysak. Does not cause Kovid-19 transmission to others.
In particular, the act of evading or fleeing from a place of abduction during the abduction that caused the transmission of KV-19 to others is punishable under the second paragraph of Article 7 of the Law on Prevention of Infection. Outbreaks of Kovid-19 and other deadly and dangerous infectious diseases. Article 7 of this law stipulates imprisonment from 6 months to 3 years and a fine from 2 million to 10 million riels.
Article 22 of the same sub-decree also stipulates that a transitional fine of 500,000 Riels to 2,000,000 Riels shall be imposed on a person who performs a willful act that does not perform the duties as stated in the first and second points of Article 13 of this sub-decree. The payment of the above transaction penalty does not exempt the person who has to perform the transcript from the obligation to perform the transcript.
Please be reminded that Mr. Muon Sophean, a man who was involved with Kovid-19 and escaped from Phnom Penh, was arrested by Pursat provincial authorities at 8:30 am on March 24, 2021 in this village. Damnak Ampil Krom, Sangkat Lolok Sor, Pursat City, Pursat Province, after this person did not cooperate with the authorities until he insulted the authorities.
