(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of April 11, 2021, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, brought the gifts of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to the people living in Trapeang Thleung 2 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao Ty 1, Po Sen Chey district, which was closed for two weeks for them to do chiropractic at home in rented rooms to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
