In fact, this afternoon, the authorities distributed them to 1,000 families, and each of these 1,000 families did not share one, by dividing it into four times, meaning that only 250 people were distributed at a time. Each to maintain a safe gap. The next day will continue to distribute more, do not let any people die of starvation.
