The locations with 19 rooms for treatment of Kovid disease include: 24 rooms in Teuk Phos district and 40 rooms in Kampong Tralach district and 104 beds already equipped. In each room, there is a bathroom and a kitchen in the room, which is convenient for patients to use on their own.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, Chairman of the Seventh Committee of the National Assembly and President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, said that caring for the well-being of the people is a natural characteristic of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia. Great from the past to the present, it is clear that he never left the Cambodian people.
Mr. Hun Many made this statement after Cambodia experienced a series of crises caused by natural disasters, especially the event of the outbreak of Kovid-19 while the Royal Government of Cambodia led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen has worked hard to combat the deadly disease by raising funds and finding all means to order the Kovid-19 vaccine to be given to government officials and citizens without hesitation.
