Mr. HUN MANY said that in fact, the measures that have been put in place have been carefully considered and balanced in all aspects, showing a strong sense of ownership, a sense of responsibility and leadership in the dire situation that the country is facing. Experienced.
"However, the introduction of measures is very important and requires the participation of all citizens," he said. The head of the Royal Government's plea to the people, of course, is to protect your own life. "Without the highest necessity and risk, he would not want to take any drastic action."
He added that the participation and sharing of the concerns of the leaders is our duty as individuals. Therefore, please implement all measures as effectively as possible and please continue to adhere to the health policy "3 do not 3 protect" consistently.
As of this morning, April 10, 2021, nearly 1 million Cambodians have been vaccinated against Kovid 19. With a total population of over 16 million and vaccinating 1 million people in Cambodia, this can be considered a quick process. If nothing changes, more than 11 million doses of the vaccine will arrive in Cambodia in a row.
