Cambodian, Vietnamese diplomats pay official visits
The invitation was made on April 9, 2021, on the occasion of Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, having a telephone conversation with Mr. Bouy Thanh Son to congratulate him on his appointment as Minister. Foreign Affairs of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam recently.
The Cambodian Ministry of Foreign Affairs stated: "Mr. Prak Sokhon has invited Mr. Bouy Thanh Son to pay an official visit to Cambodia at an appropriate time and to co-chair the 19th Cambodia-Vietnam Joint Commission (JC) Meeting, which is scheduled to be held. In Cambodia at the end of 2021.
Mr. Bouy Thanh Son also invited Mr. Prak Sokhon to visit Vietnam at an appropriate time. The two Foreign Ministers gladly accepted the invitation.
During the telephone conversation, the two Foreign Ministers honestly and fraternally discussed bilateral relations and expressed satisfaction over the steady growth of friendship and cooperation between the two countries in various fields. Education, trade, investment, energy, connectivity and security coincided with the outbreak of Kovid-19.
The two foreign ministers praised the measures and cooperation between the two sides in the fight against the Kovid-19 pandemic. In this regard, Mr. Prak Sokhon thanked the Government and people of Vietnam for providing medical equipment and financial support to the Royal Government of Cambodia in its efforts to combat the Kovid-19 pandemic.
In addition to bilateral cooperation, the two Foreign Ministers also exchanged views on regional and international issues of common interest. In this context, the Vietnamese Foreign Minister reaffirmed Vietnam's full support for Cambodia as the host of the 13th Asia-Europe Meeting (ASEM13) at the end of 2021 and chaired the rotating presidency. ASEAN in 2022.
Cambodian diplomat meets by telephone with new Vietnamese diplomat
(Phnom Penh): On April 9, 2021, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, had a telephone conversation with Mr. Bouy Thanh Son to congratulate him on his appointment as Minister of Foreign Affairs of the Republic of Cambodia. Socialist Vietnam recently. This is according to a press release from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, obtained by Fresh News.
In response, Mr. Bouy Thanh Son expressed his deep gratitude to Mr. Prak Sokhon for his congratulatory message and encouragement, which encouraged him to fulfill his new responsibilities.
In addition to bilateral cooperation, the two Foreign Ministers also exchanged views on regional and international issues of common interest. In this context, the Vietnamese Foreign Minister reaffirmed Vietnam's full support for Cambodia as the host of the 13th Asia-Europe Meeting (ASEM13) at the end of 2021 and chaired the rotating presidency. ASEAN in 2022.
