(Pursat): A senior official of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Senior Minister Kun Kim, reacted strongly to the group of people trying to sow unfortunate information about the Kovid 19 vaccine that is being injected to the people of Cambodia. The senior minister considers the Cambodian government's attempt to sow bad news on Chinese vaccines to be a hindrance to the Royal Government of Cambodia's vaccination and vaccination campaign.
On the occasion of inspecting the vaccination process for Cambodian veterans in Pursat province on Friday afternoon, April 9, 2021, Senior Minister Kun Kim, who is the Vice President and Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, emphasized that the vaccine is An important new tool to contribute to the fight against the spread of Kovid 19. In particular, protect the lives of people from harassment by Kovid 19 and lead to save the national economy.
According to Mr. Kun Kim, because of seeing the value of the vaccine for the well-being of the people and the economic recovery from Kovid 19, the Royal Government of Cambodia, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has made every effort to find the budget. And through diplomatic communication mechanisms to find vaccines to give to the people.
"Samdech Techo, the Prime Minister, has worked hard to protect the well-being of the people from Kovid 19. We have released the national budget to buy, and through the diplomatic mechanism, we have received vaccines from the Chinese government and the Kovak Association," he said. This is the effort of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, if we do not seek, we can not have a vaccine for the people, because they are very competitive.
So far, Cambodia has a total of more than 3 million doses of the vaccine and is in the process of vaccinating Cambodians. Of that, 1.3 million were for the Chinese government-funded Sinofam vaccine, 1.5 million doses were for the Sinovak vaccine purchased from a Chinese company, and 324,000 doses were for Kovak-assisted Astracinica vaccine.
As Cambodia accelerates vaccination to prevent the spread of Kovid 19, a group of people known to be anti-government groups led by Sam Rainsy's group have tried to spread bad news about the vaccine. People's trust.
Mr. Kun Kim expressed his deep regret for the poison of the opposition group, which tried to hinder the Royal Government's efforts to protect the lives of Cambodians from the Kovid 19 pandemic.
"This is their evil intention. They do not care about the common good of the nation, they do not care about the health and lives of the people who are attacked by Kovid 19, they prevent people from getting vaccinated. This is you, the substance of the anti-treason group, they are doing everything for the destruction of our nation. ” Senior Minister Kun Kim spoke in front of Cambodian veterans attending the vaccination.
On that occasion, the Senior Minister called on the people who are scheduled to be vaccinated to go to be vaccinated to protect the lives of the 19 dead Kovid, without believing any incitement to bad propaganda.
The two Chinese vaccines have now been distributed to more than 80 countries around the world, and more than 100 million people have already been vaccinated, he said. In addition, more than 810,000 Cambodians have already been vaccinated.
