In a press release, the lawyers pointed out that the defense was based on the family situation of the suspect, Phoeun Phirak, an orphan father and a former intellectual who received a scholarship at the Department of French at the Royal University of Phnom Penh. Lawyers claim that the search for legal protection is to protect the suspects' right to justice.
Please note that on the night of April 6, there was a case of violence on the street under the flyover between ABA Bank security Mr. Phoeun Phirak, 36 years old and a young man. The violence escalated into a gun battle that left the allegedly drugged young man dead as he stabbed a security guard and a suspect in the case.
Around this case of violence, social media players, including some lawyers, considered Phoeun Phirak's shooting at the victim as a case of self-defense. Social media users want to see the judiciary weigh in on the facts of the violence and favor the suspects.
