Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends a Message to Compatriots on the Occasion of National New Year
The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, always sends a message to the people of Cambodia to welcome the New Year. This year, as in previous years, in his message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen wished his compatriots, both inside and outside the country, to meet only with great glory and great happiness in the family and society.
In this message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also highlighted the efforts of the Royal Government of Cambodia to improve the lives of the people and the national economy.
This year's New Year celebrations come at a time when Cambodia is fighting fiercely against the 19 diseases that affect Cambodia as well as the world. Samdech Techo highlighted the efforts to overcome Kovid 19 to maintain the health of the people as well as public health. In particular, efforts to maintain social stability, macroeconomic stability, as well as to help solve the difficulties of people severely affected by the disease.
Samdech Techo also pledged to maintain peace and political stability and macroeconomic stability, and to continue to strictly implement all tasks set out to develop the nation and the well-being of the Cambodian people to avoid epidemics. Kovid 19 who is harassing the well-being of the people.
