The Chief of National Defense confirmed that more than 80,000 veterans from 25 capitals and provinces across the country have now started vaccinating veterans and their families in Phnom Penh. Doctors in some provinces have received Permission to vaccinate Kovid 19 to all veterans and their families in the provinces.
