(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Commerce has already vaccinated 1,364 people on the Cinewak 19 vaccine in the Sinovak vaccination campaign. The vaccination campaign for officials within the Ministry of Commerce began on April 3 and ended on April 6 yesterday.
At the closing ceremony of the vaccination campaign, Mr. Pan Sosak said that the Kovid-19 vaccine is a new tool in addition to the existing health measures to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 and save lives that help individuals. Severe pain when infected with Kovid-19 and reduced hospitalization.
