(Phnom Penh): Security guards in front of ABA Bank near Phsar Dei Huy flyover pulled out their pistols and shot dead a man instantly at the scene, according to security cameras.
Surveillance cameras showed the victim walking towards the security guard in front of the ABA Bank with a knife ready to stab the security guard, but the security guard pulled out a pistol and fired at the man. The victim was still waiting to stab the security guard, so the security guard shot him on the spot.
The incident happened at 8:57 pm on April 6, 2021, near Phsar Dei Huy flyover in Sangkat Teuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
Residents near the scene said that due to a clash of hippies fighting in front of ABA Bank, the security guards stopped the gang, but they still did not listen and were angry with the security guards until they ran away. To get a knife, he wanted to stab the security guard, so the security guard pulled out a gun and shot the victim. Ministry of Health: Vaccination of 19 Kovid disease nationwide increased to 512,334 as of April 6
