Please be informed that on the morning of April 5, 2021, yesterday, there was a case of the family of Mr. Pin Po, a tricycle rider living in Mong Barang village, Sangkat P'er, Kampong Chhnang city, Kampong Chhnang province, who was directly involved with 19 positive Kovy men. Somlo did not cooperate with health officials to take the samples for analysis. However, in the evening of the same day, the family cooperated after receiving a legal warning and an explanation from the authorities.
