A press release obtained by Fresh News stated that during the telephone conversation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his warmest congratulations to Mr. Nguyen Suon Fuc, who was elected to the 11th session of the 14th legislature. The National Assembly of Vietnam elects the President of Vietnam.
"This clearly shows the trust and appreciation of the National Assembly and the Vietnamese people for the ability, popularity and important contribution of HE Nguyen Suon Phuc in the cause of building and defending the socialist homeland of Vietnam," he said.
In response to this dialogue, Mr. Nguyen Suong Phuc sincerely thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen and reaffirmed his intention to continue to develop good neighborly relations, traditional friendship and comprehensive cooperation between the two countries for the benefit of the two countries. Of the people of both Cambodia and Vietnam and contribute to peace and stability in Southeast Asia and the world.
He expressed the belief that under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia will soon overcome the effects of Kovid 19 and continue to achieve significant economic achievements. Social work, stability of life.
In response, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his belief that in his new role as President of Vietnam, Mr. Nguyen Suon Phuc will continue to strongly support and contribute to the implementation of all cooperation agreements between the country's top leaders. Both to jointly protect and develop the relationship of solidarity, friendship and comprehensive cooperation between the two countries, Cambodia - Vietnam.
