Wang Yi: "The United States should give real respect to China's core interests"
BEIJING: Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi on Sunday called on the United States to show real respect for China's core interests. This was released by the Xinhua news agency on Monday evening, April 5, 2021.
The Chinese Foreign Minister made the remarks after being questioned by reporters about Sino-US relations after holding meetings with foreign ministers from Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, the Philippines and South Korea in Fujian. ) Of China.
According to Wang, the foreign ministers of these countries believe that China and the United States should establish more dialogue and cooperation than confrontation and fulfill their duties as superpowers. Wang stressed that China is always willing to meet both expectations and will continue to do its best.
Wang said that China's position remains unchanged and clear: China welcomes the establishment of dialogue, the establishment of cooperation on the basis of equality and mutual respect, and China strongly disagrees with the attitude. Alone is the strongest in the world "and does not accept that one country can have the final decision in world affairs.
Finally, the Chinese Foreign Minister urged the United States to meet the expectations of countries in the region and the international community by working with China to show the world what real powers should do together to maintain peace and stability. As well as regional and global development.
Ministry of Labor Notifies 19 Kovid Vaccination to Factory Workers in Phnom Penh
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training on April 05, 2021 issued a notification on vaccination against Kovid 19 to factory workers in Phnom Penh.
Vaccination of Kovid 19 to factory workers in Phnom Penh was made in accordance with the recommendation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
According to the Ministry of Labor, 30 vaccination teams will mobilize 200,000 doses per month for workers at factories in Phnom Penh.
Separately, another 30 teams of vaccinators will be mobile to vaccinate workers at factories in other provinces as needed and according to the number of vaccines available.
In this letter, the subcommittee on vaccinating Kovid 19 to workers also presented the date, location and mechanism of Kovid 19 vaccination to workers in Phnom Penh.
