The King and Queen of Cambodia have returned to Cambodia (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni and the Queen Mother of Cambodia, Norodom Monineath Sihanouk At around 4 pm on Monday, April 5, 2021, he returned to Cambodia after more than a month of medical check-ups in Beijing, China.
Leaders of the nation's top institutions, including Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross Khmer King and Queen Mother of the Khmer Nation.
Apart from that, the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, Royal Palace officials, relatives, the Governor of Phnom Penh and the Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Army were also present.
It should be noted that the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia traveled to Beijing, China to check the health of the King on March 1, 2021. During his stay in China, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni also paid a courtesy visit to Shanghai.
During the visit, the leaders of Shanghai held a solemn reception for His Majesty the King, highlighting the Cambodian flag on high-rise buildings in Shanghai. He also visited the founding site of the Chinese Communist Party and visited a restaurant that King Norodom Sihanouk visited in 1973.
