Health officials take a second sample on the staff of Lim Hong clothing store, Kampuchea Krom Street branch
(Phnom Penh): Thirty-three employees of the clothing store "Lim Hong" on the Cambodian road branch, after 14 days of stunting, were taken by health officials for the second time this morning, April 5, 2021. Health officials confirmed that for the past 14 days, the staff of this clothing store did not show any significant symptoms.
According to health officials, at the time of the second sampling today, it was only for 33 employees, and if there were no Kovid 19 symptoms, Lim Hong clothing store would be open for one to three days. Normal.
It should be noted that on the afternoon of March 22, 2021, the health officer took the owner of Lim Hong Clothes Shop, Cambodia Road Branch to the Russian Hospital for treatment after 19 cases of Kovid, while 33 staff and family were injured. The health officer took the sample and made it at the location of Lim Hong clothing store directly.
This afternoon, the King and Queen Mother of Cambodia return from China
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, and His Majesty the Queen Mother of Cambodia, Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, will return on Monday afternoon, April 5, 2021. He returned to Cambodia after the two of them spent more than a month examining the royal health in the Chinese capital, Beijing.
As planned, the leaders of the nation's top institutions, including Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, will receive Retirement of the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia.
In addition, the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, Royal Palace officials, royal family, the Governor of Phnom Penh and the Commander-in-Chief of the Cambodian Armed Forces will also visit and receive the King.
