(Phnom Penh): The “Health House” brand of massage massage sauna was cracked down on by the Po Sen Chey district authorities and 12 people were arrested as Kovid disease was rampant in the community. Listen to the instructions of the Ministry of Health.
The closing of the above massage location took place on the evening of April 4, 2011 at the intersection of Concrete Road, Trapeang Thleung 3 Village, Sangkat Choam I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Hem Darith, Governor of Por Sen Chey District, said that after the team inspected that the shop continued to operate illegally, despite the authorities' instructions and notifications, the owner did not cooperate with the Royal. Government in the fight against Kovid-19.
Authorities inspected the site and found that it was open, so the district authorities led a crackdown and temporarily closed the site and arrested 12 officers and guests and sent them to the Po Sen Chey District Police Inspectorate. To inquire and build a case to proceed with legal procedures.
Mr. Hem Darith appealed to the people, especially the business people who do business in the district, to participate in the implementation of the order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen "3 protect and 3 do not" correctly and consistently.
3 measures and 3 protections to prevent Kovid 19 effectively "3 do" means: First: Do not shake hands by turning to use our Khmer culture instead. Second, do not go to crowded places and third: Do not stay in a closed room with no ventilation, especially rooms with air conditioning.
The "3 protections" are: First, everyone must wear a mask everywhere, especially in public places. Second, wash your hands with alcohol or gel regularly and often, especially before eating and after touching objects, and third, keep a safe distance of at least one meter. Half and so on. More than 136 million doses of Kovid-19 vaccine given to people across China as of Saturday
