Initially, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration determined that if any vehicles violated the curfew, the authorities would detain them for 14 days. However, after checking and questioning the vehicle owners and seeing that there was a reasonable reason, Mr. Khuong Sreng, the Governor of Phnom Penh, decided to return the vehicle owners to their respective vehicles.
However, Governor Khuong Sreng still insisted and insisted that the people as well as vehicle owners must participate in the implementation of this curfew must not be violated or violated a second time, and this is to protect the safety of health. They also suffer from this deadly disease.
Please be informed that this curfew prohibits travel from 8pm to 5am for 14 days, except in case of necessity and priority person. This implementation took place on the night of April 2, 2021, when Mr. Khuong Sreng issued a strict order to the Armed Forces, authorities and relevant authorities to confiscate transportation at the checkpoint.
Mr. Khuong Sreng stressed that after confiscating the means, the owners were sent to work for 14 days in their respective homes. When doing so, local authorities must also monitor properly in case of non-compliance with the instructions, and will apply legal fines.
For the general public who have to travel immediately, it is necessary to inform the commune chief or local authority in advance so that the commune chief or local authority can easily inform the target of inspection on the road so that it can be done without prohibition. .
On the other hand, in case the citizen needs to travel at night during the prohibited time (not urgent but there is a definite time limit), he / she must request a certificate and a stamp from the commune chief or local authority stating the reason and purpose of the trip to Present to the authorities at the inspection target.
Commentary: Remembering the soul of a hero! China today is like a hero's wish
This year marks the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China (CPC), so this year's Cheng Meng Festival is even more unusual. Popular with Chinese audiences, it recalls China 100 years ago.
The TV series portrays the hardships of 100 years ago, when China was in a semi-colonial and semi-feudal era, a weak and impoverished nation, invaded and oppressed by a strong country.
To thank President Mao Zedong and the Chinese people for their invaluable support and assistance to Cambodia's war against the United States and Cambodia's national liberation, His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk wrote a song entitled "Victory of China People! Long live President Mao Zedong! ”
Chou Eng Lay and King Norodom Sihanouk, the two leaders, first met in April 1955 at the Asia-Africa Conference in Bandung, Indonesia, and formed a close and deep friendship. His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk once said that the Cambodian people and he were very proud to have formed a friendship with Mr. Chou Eng Lay, who was his best friend and loyal friend.
Now that the old generation of leaders has passed away, what is left for the next generation is a strong will that will not give up and work tirelessly for the ideals and the nation. Reminiscent of the souls of heroes who sacrificed their lives can get the mind and body for moving forward.
China today has achieved the aspirations of its heroes, which is to find a development path that suits the realities of China, as well as to create the miracle of rapid economic development and the miracle of long-term social stability.
But in the face of such China, some countries and some people are "concerned" and see China as a "threat" and an "enemy" by using all means to prevent China from dividing and oppressing China. China.
Faced with these unreasonable issues, the Chinese people will never give up and will unite more closely under the leadership of the Chinese Communist Party on the path of strong socialist development without any country and No force can stop China's peaceful recovery, because there is faith in the heart to go further.
The "original purpose" of the Chinese Communist Party members will guide the Chinese Communist Party members from generation to generation, succession and perseverance. From the beginning, China's goal was not to conquer any country, but to conquer oneself and become a better China. Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and Lok Chumteav Donate US $ 5,000 on the Occasion of the 158th Anniversary of the World Red Cross and Red Crescent Day, May 8, 2021
