National Assembly members hand over Kuwait philanthropic gel and alcohol to Kantha Bopha Hospital
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sos Mousin, Member of the National Assembly, Vice President of the CPPCC President of the Association of Islamic Doctors of Cambodia brought hand and alcohol cleansing gels donated by the Kuwaiti people through the Association for Social Coordination and Development to Kantha Bopha Hospital to distribute to doctors and pediatricians for use. Protect against infectious diseases, especially Kovid-19.
