(Preah Vihear): Donation of food and money as a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross through Oknha Dr. Try Pheap, Director General of Try Pheap Group and Lok Chumteav Oknha Kien Srey Neang was given to monks at six pagodas in Siem Reap and Preah Vihear provinces.
