According to the team of Oknha Dr. Try Pheap, it is confirmed that the offerings to the monks at the pagodas now follow the instructions of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to solve God's difficulties and food. Priests who were in short supply during the epidemic of Kovid 19.
On that occasion, the team also asked the monks at the pagodas to help spread the message to prevent Kovid 19 according to the health rules. In addition, the people must be informed to follow the recommendation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen "3 protect 3 do not" very strictly.
