In a message received by Fresh News, Samdech Heng Samrin emphasized, "On behalf of the National Assembly of the Kingdom of Cambodia and on my own behalf, I would like to extend my warmest congratulations to His Excellency the President-elect. The National Assembly of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam recently for the 14th legislature.
Samdech firmly believes that under the clear vision of Voeung Dinh Huy in the legislature of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam, long-term friendly relations, good neighborliness and comprehensive cooperation between the legislature and the country The two will continue to grow in the future to serve the mutual interests of the people of the villages and fences of the two friendly countries.
The President of the National Assembly of Cambodia also thanked the Socialist Republic of Vietnam for providing 390,000 face masks to Cambodia to help prevent the spread of Kovid-19, which has been plaguing the country. Lots in the world.
He wished the President of the National Assembly of Vietnam good health and success in all his endeavors and wished the Socialist Republic of Vietnam continued prosperity and prosperity for years to come.
The following is the message from Samdech Heng Samrin: Spokesman of the Ministry of Interior: 35 people were arrested for criminal and drug offenses on April 2 yesterday
