(Stung Treng): Mr. Mom Saroeun, Governor of Stung Treng Province, inspected the construction site of a research station for the production of various species of fish, especially the conservation of rare species of fish in Stung Treng Province, which will be completed by the end of 2021 in the village. Sam Khuy, Sam Khuy Commune, Sesan District, Stung Treng Province.
