Relevant authorities, please continue to look at the transportation of workers to avoid the spread of Kovid 19 (Photo this morning, April 1)
(Phnom Penh): Keeping gaps, wearing masks, not gathering are all important rules set by the Ministry of Health to prevent the transmission of Kovid 19. The February 20 community event has been expanding the impact of acute and alarming replication.
So far, Phnom Penh, Kandal, Sihanoukville and Siem Reap are all areas where the Ministry of Health has announced its duty to wear masks and keep gaps. But if you look at the transportation of workers in the textile sector, it does not seem to have implemented the measures set by the Ministry of Health or to prevent transmission.
In both Phnom Penh, Kandal and other provinces where workers are transported in the textile sector, it is observed that transportation is still the same as it was before the 19 outbreaks of Kovid. In fact, Fresh News received a lot of pictures of the transport of workers on the morning of April 1, 2021, they saw that the transport was not intermittent, and some were not wearing. Mass, too.
Continuing to adopt such transport behaviors is concerned that there may be a higher risk of transmission of Kovid 19 among workers. Although some necessary measures are taken in factories, such as keeping gaps, measuring temperature, washing hands and alcohol before going to work, if such transportation is contagious, the risk of transmission may remain the same.
Workers are the main driving force behind the operation of factories that are running their production chains in the context of Kovid 19. If workers are attacked by Kovid 19, it is clear that not only workers will be affected, factories, enterprises and the national economy will continue to be severely affected.
Therefore, working together to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 disease among workers is very important. All relevant authorities should take strict action against truck owners and workers to stop such overcrowding, with strict measures to ensure that Kovid 19 does not spread into production. Wealth.
