When a major earthquake shook Wenchuan County, killing and injuring countless people, members of the Communist Party of China (CPC) were also at the forefront of disaster relief efforts. Whenever there is a domestic flood disaster in China that endangers the lives and property of the people, you can always see the members of the Chinese Communist Party trying to be at the forefront of flood prevention and disaster relief.
