(Phnom Penh): For more than a year, Cambodia has been plagued by Kovid 19 disease. The heroism of the medical team was dubbed the White Shirt Army.
To this day, doctors are still fighting hard in the Battle of Kovid 19. Below is the writing of a doctor who is on the battlefield to save the lives of the people. The writing shows the dedication of doctors and urges people to join the fight against Kovid 19.
Please read the full text below:
As a front-line doctor, it is very difficult, but also to endure volunteering for our people. Not that I'm not afraid, not that I'm not afraid to go down and save the life of Kovid-19, and that I am not immortal, but that is the duty of a doctor. I also have a life, a family, old parents, a husband, a wife, children, waiting for me like you, but I must strive for the well-being of my people.
I really do not want any patient to lose their life and also want to be treated, want them to recover as soon as possible to return home to reunite with my family, I have to dedicate myself to the virus that we do not mail, because I also hope That will soon be back to my family. Every day, running day and night, standing in the hot sun for hours in front of their house in clothes, it is difficult to breathe to receive patients and transport them to treatment.
I dedicate my family to the hospital to treat patients and can you help me not to become another patient? Thanks in advance.
