Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration decided to use the "Modern New International" Hotel as a place to treat 19 more Kovid patients, a total of 3 locations for treating 19 Kovid patients
(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on March 27, 2021 decided to use the "Modern New International" Hotel as another treatment facility for 19 Kovid patients in the province, which is located in Village 1, Sangkat No. 3, Sihanoukville.
In the decision of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration, it is stated that the owners of modern international hotels have the following duties:
* Suspend other guests to stay in the hotel.
* Must cooperate with the provincial administrative team and officials of the provincial health department to set up the above location as a suitable place to treat Kovid-19 patients.
* Organize cleaning, disinfection at the hotel location, both inside and around the hotel premises, before taking patients for treatment and after completing the function as a treatment center for Kovid-19 patients.
* Instruct the staff and stakeholders in the hotel who need to continue to work, such as cleaners, cooks or security guards to follow the instructions of the Ministry of Health by staying separately in the hotel where the treatment is not. Must go out without permission from the competent authorities.
* Garbage must be properly packaged for the garbage company to transport and burn.
* First: Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital or Chamkar Chek Hospital, located on Chamkar Chek Street (Street 200), Village 4, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville.
