(Siem Reap): The youth group of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia "Youth Let's Visit Siem Reap" in cooperation with the authorities advertised on 12 loudspeakers on the main streets in Siem Reap to spread the rules. Prevention of Kovid 19.
The campaign, which took place on March 26, 2021, consisted of 12 tuk-tuks marching in two groups. One group has six tuk-tuks, one on the west side of the river and the other on the east side of the Siem Reap river.
According to a youth representative, the group parade lasted all morning, March 26, and then in the afternoon and the next day, the youths went to educate and promote in each district in Siem Reap. .
The above activities will be carried out for a while until the situation of infection decreases or when people are more aware of measures to prevent and prevent the spread of Kovid 19. The young people who have completed this work understand and strictly implement the three-pronged protection measures and other rules set by the Royal Government, the Ministry of Health and the relevant ministries and institutions of Siem Reap.
In addition, the Siem Reap Provincial Administration also thanked the youth for their time and resources to join the authorities in preventing the spread of Kovid-19 and for the people to understand and implement and avoid law enforcement by the authorities. About not performing the duty of wearing a mask and the duty to apply the safety gap.
